<title>HONG KONG: Li &amp; Fung names new Circle K CEO.</title>
<headline>Li &amp; Fung names new Circle K CEO.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Li &amp; Fung Ltd said it appointed its director of retailing, Butt Lau, as chief executive officer of its Hong Kong Circle K convenience store chain, effective October.</p>
<p>Lau has been managing director of Circle K since 1986, it said.</p>
<p>Circle K's present CEO, Rodney Miles, will become head of video rental chain KPS in November, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
